  "reasoning": "The claim that mRNA COVID-19 vaccines alter human DNA is scientifically false. According to molecular biology and public health agencies, mRNA delivered by vaccines functions exclusively in the cell cytoplasm to produce the spike protein and cannot enter the cell nucleus where genomic DNA resides. Furthermore, mRNA lacks the reverse transcriptase enzyme required to convert RNA into DNA, and the vaccine mRNA degrades naturally within days after cellular delivery.",
